hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1131","(154) Zabardasti fatah shuda zameen taqseem karne ka bab 1171 - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaid ibn Aslam se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Agar aakhri Musalman na hote to main koi basti fatah na karta magar use taqseem kar deta, jaisa ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Khaibar ko taqseem kiya tha."
